---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Me | Leihaopam Leisan">
    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Me</h2>

        <img
            src="/profile.jpg"
            alt="Portrait of Leihaopam Leisan"
            width="300"
        >

        <p>
            II'm Appam Leisan, a Web Design and Development student at Brigham Young University–Idaho with hands-on experience creating and maintaining websites.
I'm currently gaining professional experience as a Web Design & Development Intern at Sandhill Media Group, where I work with WordPress websites including ICON Gaming, Radio Hex, and Score Medicare.
My interests include web design, front-end development, visual design, and creating digital experiences that are both functional and visually engaging.
I'm continually developing my skills in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Python, C#, MySQL, WordPress, GitHub, Photoshop, and Illustrator.
        </p>

        <p>
            I enjoy creating accessible, responsive, and visually appealing
            websites.
        </p>

        <section id="research-interests">
            <h3>Research Interests</h3>

            <p>
                My academic interests focus on human-computer interaction (HCI),
                web accessibility, and inclusive user experience design. I am
                particularly interested in understanding how digital
                technologies can better support blind people and individuals
                with cognitive disabilities.
            </p>

            <p>
                Through my studies in Web Design and Development at Brigham
                Young University–Idaho, I have developed practical experience
                building websites and web applications. I hope to expand this
                technical foundation through doctoral research that investigates
                accessibility barriers, user experiences, and inclusive design
                methods.
            </p>

            <p>
                My long-term goal is to contribute research that helps
                developers create digital technologies that are easier to
                understand, navigate, and use independently.
            </p>
        </section>
    </section>
</Layout>